{"server":"cn","storyId":"act24side_level_act24side_04_end","groupId":"act24side","stageId":"act24side_04","title":"破空的飞羽","storyCode":"CF-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"a5d167446bb7e2f96a9f6fefb7b06d3e6464af59377b73719d98da3a55298e31","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"数量庞大的角兽反常地集结在一起，两位干员与艾露猫配合解除了危机。另一边，熟悉的声音又开始催促年老的猎人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g3_redleafforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，快去树上！角兽群要来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了！夜刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在赶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！吃我臭臭喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"工匠猫，你扔的是什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"臭！臭死了！那些羽兽又来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有效果！兽群改变方向了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工匠猫，你用的这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羽兽，臭臭！异臭球喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是这个喵！真不愧是我的小工匠，竟然这么快就拿羽兽的粪便做好了异臭球！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果把异臭球扔到怪物身上，它们就会无法忍受这个味道跑开了喵，就像我们躲开黑角一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，不要拿俺举例子啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是暂时改变了方向，角兽群仍在森林中横冲直撞，这样下去可麻烦了，火龙的踪迹很可能会被它们破坏掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"角兽的狂奔......俺觉得绝对不是正常的现象。它们怎么会无缘无故地发狂呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原因不重要，我们最好现在就阻止它们的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以我的知识推测，要使这么大规模的兽群移动，一定会有一个像领头兽一样的家伙带领方向的喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？如果是这样的话，只要把它砍了就够了，很简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，什么叫只要把它砍了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"字面意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎么去把它砍了哇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接冲进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多角兽，还都是狂奔状态下......你确定吗？发狂的原因也不能确定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有时间等待我们去确认最终原因了，我必须速战速决，你来掩护我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等！工匠猫，你还有那个......异臭球吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臭臭！好多喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"学者猫，俺想确认一下，如果把那个臭味弄在领头兽身上的话，其他的角兽有可能会散开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据它们刚刚的反应，理论上来说......会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是可能时间不会太久喵！异臭球得离得很近才能确保命中角兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，俺有个法子，让俺从树上接近，争取以最近的距离去命中领头兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀，你抓住其他角兽散开的时机跳下来，一招制服领头兽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，就这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这样你就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"更臭了而已，没有问题——呕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g3_redleafforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在......还来得及......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它们太快了，太年轻，充满力量，难以掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"过去被压抑的在膨胀，这片森林的危险从未减弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"脱离掌控，你的身躯已经衰败，你犯了太多错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......这不是理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追上去，追上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里！我看到了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在兽群中前方的位置，角大了一圈、还闪着黄色光泽的那头角兽，领头兽应该就是它喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往这边来了喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺可以做到的，俺可以做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"集中精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马上就到了，做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......俺的鼻塞好像掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊！不管了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"超大异臭球攻击！成功了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"干......干掉了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然没错，这些家伙都安静下来了喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺知道！俺臭死了，离你们远点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你受伤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没事，这点小伤......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好我这里还剩下一些应急药品，你过来，我给你处理一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哦，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位，你们快来看看这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里，领头兽的鼻子周围有沾上灰白色的粉尘喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，俺记得在哪里见过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们那儿，有一种叫作烟雪鼬的生物，它释放的烟雾状的费洛蒙会让怪物兴奋起来，不顾一切地冲锋过来喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利用这个效果来引诱怪物，我们那里“猎人”都会这么做喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，记起来了，是柏生家的那些瓶瓶罐罐，难道是那位猎人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝对是的喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"他知道了俺们进了林子，就用粉尘引诱了这些角兽发狂来阻挡俺们的去路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说来他确实说过：“不要让我看见你们——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天中午的时候他就已经前往森林了，我们是在洞穴中遭遇意外才来到森林的，他没理由知道我们的行踪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他是在森林里发现了我们，这个距离我不可能发现不了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说的话没错，而且要是他的目的也是找火龙，引发这么大的骚乱肯定会破坏火龙的踪迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺琢磨琢磨......或许有一种可能是，他想要拿这群角兽做些什么，但是情况脱离了他的掌控？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别关心这些没有意义的东西，抓紧时间找新的痕迹吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好了喵！小工匠又不见了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚在树上还在一起的喵，掉下来之后就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！不会又来了......俺不要啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺好像听到艾露猫的声音了，在那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！小工匠，你怎么了喵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"他好像......被臭晕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我希望接下来的任务里不会再有更糟糕的情况了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g4_redleafcliff"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今日的太阳正在衰落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看......叶隙的光线摇摇欲坠，叶底的黑暗声息渐起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一时冲动......误入迷途的野兽们啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们将无法从森林的黑夜归去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"第三次语音记录......嗞......\n这里是......夜刀......嗞......\n我们的设备......受到了干扰......无法正常显示......\n失去方位......\n我们......嗞......\n被困住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_500_noirc","aliases":["黑角"]}]}
